  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 5th level, as a standard action, a dragoon can call her drake companion. This functions as teleport ability of the warp sphere, using the dragoon’s caster level. When used, the drake companion appears adjacent to the dragoon (or as close as possible if all adjacent spaces are occupied). If the drake companion is out of range, the ability is wasted. The dragoon can spend 1 spell point to increase the range of this ability to medium.</p>\n<p>At 9th level, this ability’s default range increases to medium, and the dragoon can spend 1 spell point to increase its range to long.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dragoon-class#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
